Notes:

This is trying out the source code from Bican Xia and his student Liyun Dai
who submitted a paper on "LogCF" to JSC.

Unfortunately, their main theorem (root bound) is well known.
But their running time seems impressive (2-3 times faster than known
methods). 

The code is in source forge:
	http://sourceforge.net/projects/logcf/

To checkout:
	> svn checkout svn://svn.code.sf.net/p/logcf/code-0/trunk logcf-code-0

Compiling:
	"make" did not work:  I need to tell it where to find gmp...
